  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/giawbuy.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HHe76Ki.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"70\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\" width=\"1080\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">嘎嘎！Duckling 是一款旨在为《我的世界》增添鸭子、让游戏世界更加生动的模组！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duckling/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif\">查看 Forge 和 Fabric 版本的发布记录请点击这里。</span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 这个模组添加了什么？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🦆 白鸭和绿头鸭。它们会生成在河流生物群系中</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🐥 嘎嘎幼崽：一种可交易的渔夫鸭！在沼泽生物群系中四处游荡寻找它们吧！</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🍰 节日水果蛋糕，这是嘎嘎幼崽们最爱的甜点！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">🦆&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/YXC6Xh82yT\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 Discord！</a>&nbsp;🦆</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-family:arial black, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 🎨 Frogipher#4778 (美术)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 💻 ThatGravyBoat#0001 (代码)<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;只要注明出处，Duckling 可用于整合包、YouTube 视频等。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2s1ymmo.png\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fgravy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f2495544-8c9f-4513-a09d-cac8b85db731.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"142\"></span></a></span></p>",
